    "rows": [
      {
        "id": "c01",
        "outcome": "request",
        "text": "Yeah look, I'm a bit behind at the moment, things are pretty tight."
      },
      {
        "id": "c02",
        "outcome": "silent",
        "text": "Any chance we can push the payment back a couple of weeks? I get paid on the twentieth."
      },
      {
        "id": "c03",
        "outcome": "request",
        "text": "Yeah, my hours got cut at work so this month's going to be tight. Can it wait till the next one?"
      },
      {
        "id": "c04",
        "outcome": "notice",
        "text": "Is there any way to pause it for a bit? I just can't do it right now."
      },
      {
        "id": "c05",
        "outcome": "request",
        "text": "Mate, I got made redundant last month. I haven't got it, simple as that."
      },
      {
        "id": "c06",
        "outcome": "notice",
        "text": "I've been in and out of hospital since June and I can't keep up with the repayments."
      },
      {
        "id": "c07",
        "outcome": "notice",
        "text": "My husband's moved out and the loan's in both our names. I can't cover the whole thing on my own."
      },
      {
        "id": "c08",
        "outcome": "request",
        "text": "Dad passed away three weeks ago and the funeral's cleaned me out. I'm going to miss this one too."
      },
      {
        "id": "c09",
        "outcome": "request",
        "text": "The floods took the whole ground floor, we're staying at my sister's. There's no way I can pay this month."
      },
      {
        "id": "c10",
        "outcome": "notice",
        "text": "I honestly don't know what to do anymore. I can't cope with all this and I can't pay it."
      },
      {
        "id": "c11",
        "outcome": "silent",
        "text": "Could I just pay half this month and catch the rest up next month?"
      },
      {
        "id": "c12",
        "outcome": "request",
        "text": "I'm going to need a bit more time. Is there something we can work out?"
      },
      {
        "id": "c13",
        "outcome": "request",
        "text": "My casual contract finished up, so there's nothing coming in till I find something. I can't make the next payment."
      },
      {
        "id": "c14",
        "outcome": "request",
        "text": "I've had to stop work to look after my mum, she's not well. Money's stretched, I can't do the full amount."
      },
      {
        "id": "c34",
        "outcome": "request",
        "text": "I put it all on the pokies, mate. There's nothing left this fortnight."
      },
      {
        "id": "c41",
